        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "MEDITITE heightens its inner energy\nthrough meditation. It survives on\njust one berry a day.\fMinimal eating is another aspect of\nthis POKéMON’s training.",
